---
description: Refuse Done without verify-handoff gates and versioned CLI checks
alwaysApply: true
globs:
---

Before marking work Done or requesting merge:

1. Read skill `verify-handoff`.
2. Run `.cursor-plugin/agentic-dev-toolkit/bin/verify-checklist` with applicable gates.
3. Attach proofs (tests, lint/typecheck logs, screenshots). Fail = no Done.

If UI changed, also apply `visual-quality-gate` (desktop+mobile; light+dark or documented N/A). If automation was needed, confirm `no-disposable-scripts`.
